{
 "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega/v5.json",
 "description": "Live search latency at 20 searches/s through an alias while a separate process builds a second collection (HNSW_SQ8 re-index of the same vectors) and the alias moves to it. Line: p99 in ms per 15 s, by when each search was due, so queueing counts. x is minutes from the start of the build. Normal p99 (5 min before the build): 28 ms. Stage 0: before. Stage 1: insert, flush and compaction (0 to 5.33 min), with stalls at 2.4 and 5.1 min. Stage 2: index build (5.33 to 7.70 min), p99 116 ms (4x). Stage 3: the alias moves (7.70 min) and the 5 min after; 15 s p99 is back under 30 ms 3.8 min after. One run. Source: vector_search_ecom results/b4b_isolated.json and its raw load file.",
